     CRISIS RESOURCES — ALWAYS VISIBLE FIRST
═══════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="content-section" id="crisis" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">

        <div class="crisis-banner">
            <div class="crisis-banner-heading">If You Are in Immediate Danger</div>
            <p><strong>Call 911</strong> or your local emergency number.</p>
            <p>If you or someone you know is in crisis, call or text:</p>
            <span class="crisis-number"><a href="tel:988">988</a></span>
            <p>Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline &mdash; available 24/7, free and confidential.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
            This page exists because we take the safety of every person in this community seriously.
            Whether you are experiencing something personally, are worried about someone else, or
            want to report content that concerns you &mdash; you have come to the right place.
        </p>
        <p>
            You are never bothering anyone by reaching out. This is exactly what this page is for.
        </p>

        <div class="crisis-grid">
            <div class="crisis-card">
                <h3>988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</h3>
                <p>Free, confidential support for people in distress. Available 24/7.</p>
                <p class="crisis-card-contact">
                    Call or text: <a href="tel:988">988</a><br>
                    Chat: <a href="https://988lifeline.org/chat/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">988lifeline.org</a>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="crisis-card">
                <h3>Crisis Text Line</h3>
                <p>Free crisis support via text message. Available 24/7.</p>
                <p class="crisis-card-contact">
                    Text <strong>HELLO</strong> to <a href="sms:741741">741741</a>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="crisis-card">
                <h3>National Domestic Violence Hotline</h3>
                <p>Confidential support for anyone affected by domestic violence.</p>
                <p class="crisis-card-contact">
                    Call: <a href="tel:18007997233">1-800-799-7233</a><br>
                    Chat: <a href="https://www.thehotline.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">thehotline.org</a>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="crisis-card">
                <h3>SAMHSA National Helpline</h3>
