<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     REPORT A CONCERN
═══════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="content-section alt" id="report" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>Report a Concern</h2>

        <p>
            If something worries you, whether about your own safety, someone else&rsquo;s, or
            content in this community, write to Brother Aaron directly. Your message goes
            straight to him and no one else, and it is treated with the seriousness it deserves.
        </p>

        <p class="safety-email-line">
            Email: <a href="mailto:host@brotheraaron.org?subject=Safety%20concern">host@brotheraaron.org</a>
        </p>

        <p>
            Use &ldquo;Safety concern&rdquo; as your subject line so your message is seen first.
        </p>

        <p>It helps to include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>whether this is about you, someone else, or something you saw here;</li>
            <li>what is happening, sharing as much or as little as you feel comfortable;</li>
            <li>a phone number, if you would rather be called.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            <strong>Prefer <a href="https://discord.gg/tNwADDjTRV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold">Discord</a>?</strong>
            Post in <strong>#report-a-concern</strong>, or send Brother Aaron a direct message.
        </p>

        <p>
            Brother Aaron reads these personally and will respond to you himself. He is not a crisis
            service and may not see your message right away. <strong>If you or someone else is in
            danger right now, call <a href="tel:911">911</a>, or call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>.</strong>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
     CONFIDENTIALITY & NO RETALIATION
═══════════════════════════════════════ -->

<section class="content-section" id="confidentiality" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>Confidentiality and Your Protection</h2>

        <p>
            Your communication with us is treated with the highest respect and discretion.
            In cases involving the safety of a child or imminent danger to any person, we
            may be required by law to involve appropriate authorities.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Your identity as a reporter is never disclosed to the person you
            reported.</strong> This is a hard policy with no exceptions. No community member
            shall face negative consequences for filing a report in good faith. If a report
            leads to the removal of another member's content, the reporter is not identified.
            If a report is found to be without merit, the reporter&rsquo;s standing in the community is not penalized.
        </p>

        <p>
            The only exception is demonstrably malicious false reporting, which may result
            in account review.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

